# Databases

## Tổng quan So sánh

| Feature | PostgreSQL | MySQL | SQL Server |
|---------|-----------|-------|------------|
| ACID Compliance | Full | Full | Full |
| JSON Support | Excellent (JSONB) | Good (MySQL 8.0+) | Good |
| Full-Text Search | Built-in (tsvector) | Full-text indexes | Built-in |
| Replication | Streaming, Logical | Binlog, GTID | Log Shipping, AGs |
